# Shell scripts must keep LF endings regardless of the checking-out
# machine's OS/git config -- these run on Linux (inside a container or on
# a Linux build box), and a CRLF-corrupted shebang line breaks them
# outright. Found this the practical way while committing deploy/daytona-poc/.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
